{"id":"u38","kelas":11,"no":4,"judul":"Teks Eksplanasi","title":"Explanation Text","emoji":"⚙️","ringkas":"Menjelaskan proses alam dan sosial","ready":true,"goals":["memahami tujuan **explanation text**: menjelaskan **proses** (mengapa dan bagaimana sesuatu terjadi)","mengenali struktur: **General Statement** dan **Sequenced Explanation**","memakai **simple present** dan kalimat **pasif** untuk menjelaskan proses","memakai kata urutan dan sebab-akibat: [[first]], [[then]], [[after that]], [[because]], [[as a result]], [[so]]","membaca diagram proses seperti hujan, gempa, dan daur air","menulis penjelasan singkat tentang proses alam atau sosial"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Mengapa hujan turun? Bagaimana pelangi terbentuk? Bagaimana sampah plastik bisa mencemari laut? **Explanation text** menjawab pertanyaan **how** dan **why** tentang proses alam, teknologi, atau sosial. Teks ini ada di buku IPA, IPS, dan soal ujian."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur explanation text","table":[["Bagian","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**General Statement**","memperkenalkan topik atau fenomena","[[Rain is water that falls from the sky.]]"],["**Sequenced Explanation**","menjelaskan proses langkah demi langkah dan sebab-akibatnya","[[First, the sun heats the sea water. Then the water vapour rises.]]"],["**Closing** (kadang ada)","kesimpulan atau dampak akhir","[[Finally, the water falls as rain.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Perbandingan dengan procedure","table":[["","Procedure","Explanation"],["**Tujuan**","cara melakukan sesuatu","mengapa/bagaimana sesuatu terjadi"],["**Kalimat**","perintah ([[Add the sugar.]])","pernyataan ([[The water evaporates.]])"],["**Subjek**","pembaca (you)","benda/proses ([[the sun]], [[the water]])"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"process","id":"proses","ex":"Photosynthesis is a natural process."},{"en":"phenomenon","id":"fenomena","ex":"A rainbow is a natural phenomenon."},{"en":"evaporate","id":"menguap","ex":"Water evaporates when it is heated."},{"en":"condense","id":"mengembun","ex":"Vapour condenses into clouds."},{"en":"vapour","id":"uap","ex":"Water vapour rises into the air."},{"en":"cloud","id":"awan","ex":"Dark clouds bring rain."},{"en":"cause","id":"penyebab / menyebabkan","ex":"Heavy rain causes floods."},{"en":"result","id":"akibat / hasil","ex":"As a result, the river overflows."},{"en":"form","id":"terbentuk / membentuk","ex":"Clouds form in the sky."},{"en":"release","id":"melepaskan","ex":"Plants release oxygen."},{"en":"absorb","id":"menyerap","ex":"Leaves absorb sunlight."},{"en":"earthquake","id":"gempa bumi","ex":"An earthquake shakes the ground."},{"en":"volcano","id":"gunung berapi","ex":"A volcano erupts and releases lava."},{"en":"flood","id":"banjir","ex":"A flood covers the road."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Kata urutan dan sebab-akibat","table":[["Fungsi","Kata / ungkapan","Contoh"],["Urutan","[[first]], [[then]], [[next]], [[after that]], [[finally]]","[[First, the sun heats the water.]]"],["Waktu","[[when]], [[as soon as]], [[until]], [[while]]","[[When the vapour cools, it condenses.]]"],["Sebab","[[because]], [[since]], [[due to]]","[[Floods happen because the river overflows.]]"],["Akibat","[[so]], [[therefore]], [[as a result]], [[consequently]]","[[It rains heavily. As a result, the river overflows.]]"],["Kata kerja sebab","[[cause]], [[lead to]], [[result in]]","[[Deforestation leads to floods.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Simple present dan passive voice","table":[["Bentuk","Rumus","Contoh"],["**Simple present aktif**","subjek + V1 (-s/-es)","[[The sun heats the water.]]"],["**Simple present pasif**","is/are + V3","[[The water is heated by the sun.]]"],["**Pasif jamak**","are + V3","[[Clouds are formed in the sky.]]"],["**Pasif dengan by**","is/are + V3 + by + pelaku","[[Oxygen is released by plants.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Kapan memakai pasif","text":"Pakai pasif ketika **prosesnya lebih penting daripada pelakunya**: [[Rice is planted in March.]] Pelaku ([[by + ...]]) hanya ditambahkan bila perlu."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: How Rain Is Formed","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Rain is water that falls from the clouds to the earth. It is part of the water cycle, which never stops.","id":"Hujan adalah air yang jatuh dari awan ke bumi. Hujan merupakan bagian dari siklus air yang tidak pernah berhenti."},{"who":"Text","en":"First, the sun heats the water in the sea, rivers, and lakes. The water evaporates and turns into water vapour. Then the vapour rises into the air.","id":"Pertama, matahari memanaskan air di laut, sungai, dan danau. Air menguap dan berubah menjadi uap air. Kemudian uap naik ke udara."},{"who":"Text","en":"Next, the air at a high place is cold, so the vapour condenses and forms clouds. When the clouds become heavy, the tiny drops of water fall as rain.","id":"Selanjutnya, udara di tempat tinggi dingin, sehingga uap mengembun dan membentuk awan. Ketika awan menjadi berat, tetesan air kecil jatuh sebagai hujan."},{"who":"Text","en":"Finally, the rain water flows into rivers and the sea, and the cycle begins again.","id":"Akhirnya, air hujan mengalir ke sungai dan laut, lalu siklus dimulai lagi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mengapa banjir terjadi?","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Why do floods happen, Rani?","id":"Mengapa banjir terjadi, Rani?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Floods happen when heavy rain falls and the river cannot hold all the water.","id":"Banjir terjadi ketika hujan deras turun dan sungai tidak dapat menampung semua air."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. What else can cause floods?","id":"Bagus. Apa lagi yang dapat menyebabkan banjir?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"Rubbish blocks the water, so it flows onto the road.","id":"Sampah menyumbat air, sehingga air mengalir ke jalan."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Excellent. You explain the cause and the result.","id":"Bagus sekali. Kalian menjelaskan sebab dan akibatnya."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Membaca diagram proses","text":"Ikuti **panah** dari awal ke akhir. Tiap kotak biasanya satu langkah. Tulis ulang dengan kata urutan: [[First ... Then ... Next ... Finally ...]], dan hubungkan sebab-akibat dengan [[so]] atau [[as a result]]."},{"t":"summary","items":["Explanation text menjelaskan **proses** (how/why): General Statement → Sequenced Explanation.","Memakai **simple present** dan sering **passive voice** ([[is/are + V3]]).","Kata urutan: [[first]], [[then]], [[next]], [[finally]]; sebab-akibat: [[because]], [[so]], [[as a result]].","Beda dari procedure: explanation menjelaskan proses, bukan memberi perintah."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["process","proses"],["evaporate","menguap"],["condense","mengembun"],["vapour","uap"],["cloud","awan"]],"exp":"Kosakata proses hujan.","k":"2e08c14f"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["earthquake","gempa bumi"],["volcano","gunung berapi"],["flood","banjir"],["absorb","menyerap"]],"exp":"Kosakata fenomena alam.","k":"6f749d2b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian teks dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["General Statement","memperkenalkan fenomena"],["Sequenced Explanation","menjelaskan proses"],["Closing","kesimpulan atau dampak akhir"]],"exp":"Bagian explanation text; closing tidak selalu ada.","k":"8ad27ffa"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan explanation text adalah...","options":["menjelaskan bagaimana atau mengapa sesuatu terjadi","mengajak orang datang","menceritakan dongeng","memberi perintah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Explanation menjelaskan proses.","k":"863ee2f4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian yang memperkenalkan fenomena disebut...","options":["general statement","sequenced explanation","goal","complication"],"answer":0,"exp":"General statement = pernyataan umum.","k":"b1d8f410"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan pada explanation text adalah...","options":["simple present","simple past","future perfect","past continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Proses alam dijelaskan dengan simple present.","k":"72073428"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["The water evaporates when it is heated.","The water evaporate when it is heated.","The water evaporating when it is heated.","The water evaporated when it heated."],"answer":0,"exp":"Subjek tunggal + verb-s.","k":"2f745f78"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pasif yang benar adalah...","options":["Clouds are formed in the sky.","Clouds is formed in the sky.","Clouds are form in the sky.","Clouds forming in the sky."],"answer":0,"exp":"are + V3.","k":"24fc2334"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"The sun heats the water. ___, the water evaporates.\"","options":["Then","Because","Although","Unless"],"answer":0,"exp":"Then = kemudian.","k":"0a5c4a37"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"It rains heavily. ___, the river overflows.\"","options":["As a result","First","For example","In addition"],"answer":0,"exp":"As a result = akibatnya.","k":"ee70f396"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, apa yang terjadi setelah uap air naik ke udara dingin?","options":["uap mengembun dan membentuk awan","air menguap menjadi gas","matahari terbit","sungai kering"],"answer":0,"exp":"The vapour condenses and forms clouds.","k":"91b2a3ec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menurut Teks 1, siklus air...","options":["tidak pernah berhenti","hanya terjadi sekali","terjadi di gurun saja","dihentikan oleh hujan"],"answer":0,"exp":"The water cycle never stops.","k":"e2868f86"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang termasuk explanation, bukan procedure?","options":["The vapour rises and forms clouds.","Boil the water.","Add the sugar.","Don't touch the stove."],"answer":0,"exp":"Explanation berupa pernyataan, bukan perintah.","k":"372f61b3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Matahari memanaskan air laut.","q":"The sun ___ the sea water. (heat)","answers":["heats"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"Subjek tunggal memakai heats.","k":"5330667f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Awan terbentuk di langit.","q":"Clouds are ___ in the sky. (form)","answers":["formed"],"hint":"V3","exp":"are + V3.","k":"6d1527cb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tumbuhan melepaskan oksigen.","q":"Plants ___ oxygen. (release)","answers":["release"],"hint":"subjek jamak","exp":"Subjek jamak, tanpa -s.","k":"af875651"},{"type":"fill","id":"Banjir terjadi karena sungai meluap.","q":"Floods happen ___ the river overflows.","answers":["because"],"hint":"karena","exp":"because + klausa.","k":"2160414f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertama, matahari memanaskan air.","q":"___, the sun heats the water.","answers":["first","First"],"hint":"pertama","exp":"First = pertama.","k":"ae12691d"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Uap air naik ke udara.\"","answer":"The water vapour rises into the air.","exp":"Subjek + kata kerja + keterangan tempat.","k":"313d5f16"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Hujan deras menyebabkan banjir.\"","answer":"Heavy rain causes floods.","exp":"cause = menyebabkan.","k":"e176bc5c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Water evaporates when it is heated","options":["Air menguap ketika dipanaskan","Air membeku","Air diminum","Air itu bersih"],"answer":0,"exp":"evaporate = menguap.","k":"ac9d62a8"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Clouds are formed in the sky","options":["Awan terbentuk di langit","Awan dibeli di toko","Langit itu biru","Awan jatuh ke bumi"],"answer":0,"exp":"are formed = terbentuk.","k":"551ac807"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"As a result the river overflows","options":["Akibatnya sungai meluap","Sungai itu panjang","Aku menyeberangi sungai","Sungai itu kering"],"answer":0,"exp":"as a result = akibatnya.","k":"722e82fc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Uap air mengembun menjadi awan.","q":"Water vapour ___ into clouds. (condense)","answers":["condenses"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"condenses = mengembun.","k":"aadd35b6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gunung berapi meletus dan melepaskan lava.","q":"A volcano ___ and releases lava. (erupt)","answers":["erupts"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"erupts = meletus.","k":"e597bb86"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gempa bumi mengguncang tanah.","q":"An earthquake ___ the ground. (shake)","answers":["shakes"],"hint":"he/she/it + s","exp":"shakes = mengguncang.","k":"275baf97"},{"type":"fill","id":"Padi ditanam di sawah.","q":"Rice ___ planted in the fields.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are","exp":"Rice tunggal, memakai is.","k":"b07a072f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sampah dibuang ke tempat sampah.","q":"Rubbish ___ thrown into the bin.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are","exp":"is + V3.","k":"1f0b55cf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Buah-buahan dijual di pasar.","q":"Fruits ___ sold at the market.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are","exp":"Fruits jamak, memakai are.","k":"51867d58"},{"type":"fill","id":"Karena itu, sungai meluap.","q":"___ , the river overflows. (jadi)","answers":["so","So","therefore","Therefore"],"hint":"jadi","exp":"so / therefore.","k":"d345607f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selanjutnya, uap naik ke udara.","q":"___, the vapour rises into the air.","answers":["next","Next","then","Then"],"hint":"selanjutnya","exp":"Next / then = selanjutnya.","k":"a10e5670"},{"type":"fill","id":"Banjir dapat disebabkan oleh sampah.","q":"Floods can be ___ by rubbish. (cause)","answers":["caused"],"hint":"V3","exp":"can be + V3.","k":"fa1e3e97"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pasif dari \"The sun heats the water\" adalah...","options":["The water is heated by the sun.","The water heats by the sun.","The water was heat by the sun.","The water are heated by the sun."],"answer":0,"exp":"is + V3 + by.","k":"fccaaa92"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Aktif dari \"Oxygen is released by plants\" adalah...","options":["Plants release oxygen.","Plants released oxygen.","Plants are release oxygen.","Plants releasing oxygen."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pelaku menjadi subjek.","k":"5b07342f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa langit mendung sebelum hujan?","options":["karena awan berkumpul","karena bulan terbit","karena laut kering","karena angin berhenti"],"answer":0,"exp":"Awan yang berkumpul membuat langit gelap.","k":"25072375"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat \"Plants absorb sunlight to make food.\" menjelaskan...","options":["proses fotosintesis","cara membuat kue","pesta ulang tahun","pendapat penulis"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menjelaskan proses alam.","k":"c1b16ba3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pembuka yang cocok untuk teks explanation adalah...","options":["An earthquake is a sudden shaking of the ground.","Mix the flour and the eggs.","Dear Diary, today I was happy.","You are invited to my party."],"answer":0,"exp":"General statement memperkenalkan fenomena.","k":"06f07aeb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang bukan bagian proses hujan?","options":["The farmer sells vegetables.","Water evaporates.","Vapour condenses.","Clouds become heavy."],"answer":0,"exp":"Penjualan sayur tidak termasuk proses hujan.","k":"c3b75f5e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"consequently\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["akibatnya","pertama","misalnya","namun"],"answer":0,"exp":"consequently = akibatnya.","k":"a63d16c8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"due to\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["disebabkan oleh","setelah itu","sebelum","meskipun"],"answer":0,"exp":"due to = karena/disebabkan oleh.","k":"33db5806"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["Volcanoes erupt when pressure builds up.","Volcanoes erupts when pressure builds up.","Volcanoes erupting when pressure builds up.","Volcanoes erupt when pressure build up."],"answer":0,"exp":"Subjek jamak: erupt; builds untuk pressure tunggal.","k":"912091a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menyatakan sebab?","options":["Floods happen because rubbish blocks the river.","Floods are dangerous.","Floods are in the news.","Floods come in summer."],"answer":0,"exp":"because menandai sebab.","k":"202b5a72"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menyatakan akibat?","options":["Therefore, many houses are damaged.","Because it rained.","When the river is full.","If the weather is bad."],"answer":0,"exp":"Therefore menandai akibat.","k":"a1754fe8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks \"First, ... Then, ... Finally, ...\" dengan subjek benda (the water, the sun) adalah teks...","options":["explanation","procedure","invitation","report"],"answer":0,"exp":"Penjelasan proses alam, bukan perintah.","k":"d40dd1ce"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Awan terbentuk ketika uap mengembun.\"","answer":"Clouds are formed when the vapour condenses.","exp":"are formed + when.","k":"f3803481"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan fenomena dengan penyebab utamanya:","pairs":[["rain","water vapour condenses"],["flood","river overflows"],["earthquake","ground plates move"],["eruption","pressure inside a volcano"]],"exp":"Sebab fenomena alam.","k":"f2fc6979"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"A volcano erupts and releases lava","options":["Gunung berapi meletus dan melepaskan lava","Gunung itu tinggi","Aku mendaki gunung","Lava itu dingin"],"answer":0,"exp":"erupts = meletus.","k":"918f39e3"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Heavy rain causes floods","options":["Hujan deras menyebabkan banjir","Banjir menyebabkan hujan","Hujan itu menyenangkan","Aku suka banjir"],"answer":0,"exp":"cause = menyebabkan.","k":"22873619"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hujan terjadi ketika uap air mengembun.","q":"Rain occurs when water vapor ___. (condense)","answers":["condenses"],"hint":"mengembun","exp":"condenses.","k":"7192f2a5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Air laut menguap karena panas matahari.","q":"Seawater ___ because of the heat of the sun. (evaporate)","answers":["evaporates"],"hint":"menguap","exp":"evaporates.","k":"0a806836"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertama, matahari memanaskan air.","q":"First, the sun ___ the water. (heat)","answers":["heats"],"hint":"memanaskan","exp":"heats.","k":"fd465b72"},{"type":"fill","id":"Akibatnya, awan terbentuk.","q":"As a ___, clouds form.","answers":["result"],"hint":"akibat","exp":"As a result.","k":"8c2333fa"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gempa terjadi karena lempeng bergeser.","q":"Earthquakes happen ___ plates move.","answers":["because"],"hint":"karena","exp":"because.","k":"17570aa5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Proses ini disebut fotosintesis.","q":"This process is ___ photosynthesis.","answers":["called"],"hint":"disebut","exp":"is called.","k":"13db7eaf"},{"type":"fill","id":"Setelah itu, uap berubah menjadi air.","q":"___ that, the vapor turns into water.","answers":["After"],"hint":"setelah","exp":"After that.","k":"dd4ae7c9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Karena itu, tanaman membutuhkan cahaya.","q":"That is ___ plants need light.","answers":["why"],"hint":"mengapa","exp":"That is why.","k":"69bf5e42"},{"type":"fill","id":"Air hujan mengalir ke sungai.","q":"Rainwater ___ into the river. (flow)","answers":["flows"],"hint":"mengalir","exp":"flows.","k":"687c8e7c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan explanation text:","options":["menjelaskan proses atau sebab-akibat","membujuk","menceritakan pengalaman","mengajak hadir"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menjelaskan proses.","k":"991566a2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Struktur explanation text:","options":["general statement – sequence of explanation","thesis – arguments","orientation – events","goal – steps"],"answer":0,"exp":"General statement dulu.","k":"da052d99"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata penghubung sebab-akibat:","options":["therefore","once upon a time","dear sir","first of all"],"answer":0,"exp":"therefore.","k":"4da8ee77"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang menunjukkan akibat?","options":["As a result, the river overflowed.","The river is long.","I like rivers.","Rivers are blue."],"answer":0,"exp":"As a result.","k":"69d87aba"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Eruption\" artinya...","options":["letusan","gempa","banjir","badai"],"answer":0,"exp":"eruption.","k":"177746c8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Flood\" artinya...","options":["banjir","kekeringan","angin","salju"],"answer":0,"exp":"flood.","k":"aa92c643"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pasif untuk proses:","options":["The water is heated by the sun.","The sun heating wat